A wide valley of green meadows and scattered houses stretches under an autumn dusk, where a distant church tower rises prominently above the rooftops across the fields at right of centre, its bell swinging within the open belfry. In the foreground, open grassy slopes decline gently downward, dotted with dry golden and rust-coloured fallen leaves from scattered hedgerows. Across the valley floor, the clustered white and cream buildings of the town rest quietly beneath a long wooded ridge tinged with autumn orange and brown. Twilight settles softly over the quiet landscape with cool blue and amber tones in the fading sky, and no people or animals move across the vast, peaceful outdoor scene. Ultra-wide establishing shot capturing the quiet countryside and the ringing bell tower.

---METADATA---
