Seen over the shoulder of Léa, who stands on the stone terrace step, a small brown hedgehog named Pic trots through the crunching autumn maple leaves across the lawn with a pale grey stuffed rabbit balanced across his spiny back. Léa appears in the foreground corner cropped at the back of her head, dark brown straight hair cut chin-length with bangs visible at the side, and the shoulder of her red flannel pyjamas. Down on the lawn in the midground, Pic scampers toward the leaf pile, his cream-coloured snout and small rounded ears visible as he steps quickly, the long floppy pink-lined ears of the stuffed rabbit dangling down his spiny flank. The dim evening light washes over the wet grass, the scattered red and gold maple leaves, and the garden path. Over-the-shoulder shot looking down from the stone terrace toward the lawn.

---METADATA---
