Léa stands firmly on the stone terrace step and stamps one foot in her thick red wool socks, leaning forward with both small fists clenched at her sides as she shouts across the garden. The toddler girl has straight chin-length dark brown hair with neat bangs, rounded cheeks, brown eyes, and wears a red flannel pyjama top with a button front and matching red flannel pyjama trousers. Down across the grass in the midground, Pic the hedgehog pauses beside a dense mound of autumn leaves, holding one long pink-lined ear of the pale grey stuffed toy rabbit firmly in his mouth, his round dark eyes looking back toward the terrace. Dusk shadows deepen over the damp lawn, where red and golden maple leaves lie scattered around the grey stone terrace steps. Medium shot capturing Léa's frustration and the stubborn hedgehog standing his ground by the leaf pile.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Léa stamps on the terrace step and demands her rabbit back while Pic halts near the autumn leaf pile, holding the rabbit by its ear. The garden is dim under the dusk sky.","characters":[{"name":"Léa","clothing":"nightwear","position":"on the terrace step","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows sharply angled, eyes wide with frustration, mouth open in a shout"}],"era":"present day","weather":"clear","objects":[],"creatures":[{"id":"ANI001","depth":"midground","looksAt":"Léa","expression":"brows level, large dark eyes open, mouth gripping the ear firmly","emotion":"neutral"}],"interactions":[{"character":"Léa","object":"ANI001","where":"stamps and shouts toward the hedgehog","action":"standing","hands":false,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"low"},{"character":"ANI001","object":"ART003","where":"grips the stuffed rabbit by its ear","action":"holding the rabbit ear","hands":false,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"}],"wornItems":[]}

Jules sprints rapidly down the damp lawn, leaning forward mid-stride with his arm extended, gripping a black plastic flashlight whose bright beam bounces across the grass toward the wooden shed at the far edge of the garden. The young school-age boy has short combed dark brown hair, blue eyes, and wears a green wool crew-neck jumper over a white t-shirt, grey corduroy trousers, and blue canvas trainers with white soles. At the base of the weathered timber shed in the background, Pic the hedgehog bolts into the shadowy under-gap, dragging the pale grey plush rabbit, the animal's small spiny tail and the rabbit's white tail just disappearing beneath the boards. Fallen maple leaves scatter in the wake of the running boy beneath the darkening autumn sky. Wide shot showing the open lawn, the bounding flashlight beam, and the hedgehog darting under the shed.

---METADATA---
