Seen over the shoulder of Jules, who lies flat on his stomach upon the damp grass, his arm is thrust deep into the narrow opening beneath the weathered timber shed. Jules is cropped close in the foreground corner showing the back of his dark combed hair and the shoulder of his green knitted wool jumper, his fingers clutching the black flashlight as the beam shoots into the black recess, illuminating only bare earth and old brick. Further back inside the shadowy gap, Pic the hedgehog cowers against the packed soil beside the pale grey stuffed rabbit, his spines bristling slightly and his round eyes reflecting a faint glimmer of light. Red and gold maple leaves lie flattened against the damp garden dirt along the edge of the shed base. Over-the-shoulder shot framed at ground level looking into the dark gap beneath the shed.

---METADATA---
