Élodie leans out through the cream wooden frame of the open kitchen terrace door, reaching one arm forward to beckon Léa, who pauses halfway up the grey stone terrace steps and looks anxiously back toward the dark garden. Élodie is an adult woman with long wavy light brown hair falling to mid-back, brown eyes, wearing a long yellow ribbed cardigan over a white long-sleeve top, slim brown trousers, and tan boots. On the steps, the toddler Léa turns her body toward the house, wearing her red flannel pyjamas and thick red wool socks, her small hands hovering near her chest as her big brown eyes gaze into the dim distance where the shed stands hidden in twilight. Dry maple leaves rustle around the stone steps under the cool autumn dusk. Medium shot looking at the doorway and the terrace steps.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Élodie calls Léa back from the terrace doorway while Léa hesitates on the steps, gazing back toward the dark lawn. The kitchen doorway glows warmly behind Élodie.","characters":[{"name":"Élodie","clothing":"standard","position":"in the terrace doorway","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows raised with concern, eyes wide, mouth parted calling out"},{"name":"Léa","clothing":"nightwear","position":"on the terrace steps","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows lifted and troubled, eyes wide, mouth trembling slightly"}],"era":"present day","weather":"clear","objects":[],"interactions":[{"character":"Élodie","object":"LOC002.2","where":"steps through the terrace doorway calling out","action":"standing","hands":false,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"low"},{"character":"Léa","object":"LOC002.2","where":"turns on the stone steps toward the doorway","action":"standing","hands":false,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"low"}],"wornItems":[]}

Léa clings tightly to the cream wooden doorframe of the terrace door with both small hands, her fingers gripping the smooth wood as she stares out into the cold black garden beyond the porch lamp. The toddler girl has chin-length straight dark brown hair with bangs resting above her eyebrows, soft rounded cheeks, and wears her buttoned red flannel pyjama top. Across the kitchen in the background, Henri stands near the pale wooden counter, his stooped elderly frame clad in a brown wool cardigan, grey trousers, and black shoes, peering down in search of his black-framed reading glasses which rest on the counter beside a ceramic jug. Outside the doorway, the autumn dusk has deepened into night, and the slow chimes of the distant church bell echo faintly over the quiet valley. Close-up shot focusing from the waist up on Léa's sorrowful face at the doorway.

---METADATA---
