Léa lies cozy and safe in her single bed under a pale blue patchwork quilt, hugging the pale grey stuffed toy rabbit tightly against her chest with both arms, her head turned toward the bedroom window with a gentle smile. The toddler girl wears her red flannel pyjamas, her dark brown hair resting against a white pillow. In the background at the open bedroom doorway, Marc in his blue checked shirt, Élodie in her yellow cardigan, Jules in his green jumper, and Henri in his brown cardigan stand together, seen from behind as they turn quietly toward the hallway. A small bedside lamp casts a warm, soft glow across the pale wooden floor and the cream walls of the bedroom. Wide shot capturing Léa resting happily in bed while her family leaves the quiet room for the night.

