urning to leave","action":"standing","hands":false,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"low"},{"character":"Henri","object":"LOC004","where":"stands in the bedroom doorway turning to leave","action":"standing","hands":false,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"low"}],"wornItems":[]}

Léa stands upright on the green lawn beside Pic the hedgehog, both facing forward toward the viewer under a clear autumn dusk sky, whole figures visible from head to toe. Léa, a toddler girl about four heads tall with rounded cheeks, straight chin-length dark brown hair and neat bangs, wears a red polka dot dress with white dots, white tights, and black mary jane shoes, smiling cheerfully with her hands resting lightly at her sides. Beside her on the grass, Pic stands upright on all four soft paws, his warm brown spines neat, with his cream-coloured snout, pink nose tip, and large round dark eyes looking warmly ahead. Behind them, the stone terrace steps lead up toward the cream house wall, with scattered red and golden autumn maple leaves resting across the green garden lawn. Wide shot showing the child and hedgehog standing together in the open garden.

