The entire family stands gathered together on the stone terrace steps under the soft autumn twilight, all five figures whole in frame and facing forward toward the viewer. Henri stands slightly stooped in his brown wool cardigan, cream shirt, grey trousers, black shoes, and wire-rimmed glasses, beside Marc who wears his blue checked flannel shirt, blue jeans, and brown leather boots. In the center, toddler Léa wears her red polka dot dress, white tights, and black shoes, flanked by young school-age Jules in his green wool crew-neck jumper, grey corduroy trousers, and blue canvas trainers, and Élodie in her long yellow cardigan, white scoop-neck top, slim brown trousers, and tan boots. Behind the group, the white metal railing borders the grey stone terrace, while scattered red and gold maple leaves accent the ground. Wide shot capturing the five family members posed together in the garden.

