Gathered on the stone terrace step in the quiet autumn dusk, the family poses together facing forward toward the viewer, every figure whole in frame, with toddler Léa sitting comfortably on the step holding her pale grey stuffed toy rabbit in her lap. Léa wears her red polka dot dress, white tights, and black shoes, with Jules sitting beside her in his green jumper and grey trousers. Standing directly behind them on the stone terrace floor, Élodie in her yellow cardigan, Marc in his blue checked shirt, and elderly Henri in his brown cardigan, grey trousers, and round glasses look forward with warm smiles. Red and orange maple leaves lie scattered around their feet, and the garden lawn stretches away behind the terrace into the soft evening dusk. Wide shot showing the family resting together on the garden terrace.

